<item>
<title>A fantastic showing at County Backpack</title>
<description>Last weekend seven teams from Hatfield Forest District threw themselves into the challenge of County Backpack, along with 600 scouts from across the county, in the countryside around Thorrington Camp near Colchester. Follow the link to read about it!</description>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://hatfieldforestdistrictscouts.org.uk/assets/2026-04-04-backpack-report/2026-04-04+County+Backpack+Report.pdf</guid>
</item>
<item>
<title>CamJam 2026 - Bookings Open</title>
<description>31 Jul - 7 Aug 2027 will bring us CamJam 2027. The team is gearing up to provide an unforgettable week of adventure, friendship and discovery as we bring together around 3,000 Scouts and Guides plus 2,000 volunteers from across the UK and overseas. Location: Abbots Ripton Estate (Huntingdon)</description>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://hatfieldforestdistrictscouts.org.uk/https://camjam.org.uk/</guid>
</item>
